{'symbol': 'HON', 'date': '2021-07-14 09:00:00', 'title': 'HONEYWELL NAMES TWO NEW SEGMENT LEADERS AND CHIEF OPERATING OFFICER FOR HIGH GROWTH REGIONS', 'text': 'CHARLOTTE, N.C., JULY 14, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0HONEYWELL (NASDAQ: HON) ANNOUNCED TODAY NEW LEADERS OF ITS PERFORMANCE MATERIALS AND TECHNOLOGIES (PMT) AND HONEYWELL BUILDING TECHNOLOGIES (HBT) SEGMENTS, AND A NEW CHIEF OPERATING OFFICER OF GLOBAL HIGH GROWTH REGIONS.'}